# Independent VD quasi-1D MOS auxiliary model, NOT the full MOSFET.
# Source: user-supplied channel/poly NET doping profiles.
# Net profiles are reconstructed as effective ionized acceptors/donors.
# Separate chemical species, compensation, activation and damage are unavailable.
# Piecewise-constant profile reconstruction, with all source samples retained.
# Actual SiO2/HfO2 layers retained; uses material-database dielectric parameters.
# Add any explicit MATERIAL/INTERFACE overrides used in the original VD deck.
# Criterion: near-surface electron density equals local effective acceptor density.
# This is a strong-inversion criterion, NOT QUICKMOS conductance-extrapolated Vt.
# No quantum correction; gate n.poly and Qf=0 are explicit modelling assumptions.
go victorydevice

